{"id":"532684","name":"樱花馒头","author":"给宝贝做的饭","authorId":"1900992","desc":"","cover":"images/532684/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"400克"},{"name":"水","amount":"200克"},{"name":"油","amount":"4克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"15克"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"3克"}],"sub":[{"name":"仙人掌果粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"把所有主料混合，揉成光滑适当的面团。","img":"images/532684/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"取一半面团加入仙人掌果粉，揉成粉色。","img":"images/532684/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"擀成片，用切模切出圆片或下成小剂子擀成圆片。","img":"images/532684/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取一个圆片，等切成五瓣，中间不切断，","img":"images/532684/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把每瓣的两端捏合在一起。","img":"images/532684/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"随便找个带尖角的模具，把尖部切掉。","img":"images/532684/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"两种颜色面团依次做好。","img":"images/532684/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用剩下的边角面团擀开，压出粉色和白色的小花。","img":"images/532684/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"粘在中间做花蕊，生坯就做好了。","img":"images/532684/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"做好的生坯发酵至2倍大，放入美遇蒸烤箱中。","img":"images/532684/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"选择蒸汽模式，100度17分钟即可。","img":"images/532684/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/532684/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/532684/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/532684/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/532684/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/532684/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/532684/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/532684/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}